#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_securetransfer_privacy.purpose_securetransfer
msgid ""
"When a document is delivered to you through a secure link, the\n"
"                file is placed on encrypted storage and the link that leads to\n"
"                it expires on a date set in advance. Your email address is used\n"
"                to send you this link and to record who downloaded what, and\n"
"                when."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_securetransfer_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_securetransfer_privacy.purpose_securetransfer
msgid ""
"Once the expiry date has passed, the file is deleted from the\n"
"                storage. The access log and the transfer record are kept without\n"
"                the content, because they are the proof of what was\n"
"                delivered."
msgstr ""

